        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-283 (ensure controlled execution — Brand, PR &amp; Corporate Communications (PA-14.3).) | - operational: Retail Media Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Retail Media Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
